---
/**
 * Servicios Grid — Sección 2.
 * 5 bento cards: Web Pentesting, Mobile Security, Ethical Hacking,
 * Red Team (con progress bar 84%), Compliance Audit + circuit banner.
 */
---

<div class="py-20 px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop max-w-container-max mx-auto relative">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
    <!-- Service 1: Consultoría de Seguridad (span 2) -->
    <div class="bento-card p-6 lg:col-span-2 relative group overflow-hidden scroll-reveal">
      <div class="scanner-line"></div>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 flex-shrink-0 bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary group-hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors animate-pulse-slow">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">language</span>
            </div>
            <div class="text-right">
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold">TYPE_STK: WEB_APP</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary/40">ID: 0x9421</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm mb-4 text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tight group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
            Consultoría de Seguridad
          </h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8 leading-relaxed opacity-80">
            Fortalecemos la resiliencia de su organización mediante consultoría estratégica basada en los estándares más exigentes de la industria ofensiva.
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-3 border-l-2 border-primary">
              <div class="text-[9px] text-primary/60 font-mono">VULN_TARGET</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface font-mono">SQLi / XSS</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-3 border-l-2 border-primary">
              <div class="text-[9px] text-primary/60 font-mono">AUTH_VERIF</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface font-mono">BROKEN_AUTH</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-3 border-l-2 border-primary">
              <div class="text-[9px] text-primary/60 font-mono">API_AUDIT</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface font-mono">ENDPOINT_SEC</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-surface-container p-3 border-l-2 border-primary">
              <div class="text-[9px] text-primary/60 font-mono">ZERO_DAY</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface font-mono">DISCOVERY</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/3 image-container border border-primary/20 group-hover:border-primary/50 transition-colors">
          <div class="scanner-line"></div>
          <img
            alt="Terminal Interface"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale brightness-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:brightness-75 transition-all duration-700"
            src="/image/a_futuristic_cybersecurity_terminal_interface_dark_room_red_glowing_matrix_code.png"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 2: Auditoría de Infraestructura -->
    <div class="bento-card p-6 relative group overflow-hidden scroll-reveal">
      <div class="scanner-line" style="animation-delay: 1s"></div>
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">smartphone</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold mb-1">TYPE_STK: MOBILE_OS</div>
      <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm mb-4 text-on-surface uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
        Auditoría de Infraestructura
      </h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8 opacity-80">
        Analizamos exhaustivamente su superficie de ataque para identificar vectores de infiltración y debilidades críticas en su infraestructura tecnológica.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-primary/20 pt-6">
        <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-primary/70">REVERSE_ENG</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold animate-pulse">READY</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono">
          <span class="text-primary/70">DECRYPT_ALGO</span>
          <span class="text-primary font-bold animate-pulse">ACTIVE</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 3: Ethical Hacking -->
    <div class="bento-card p-6 relative group border-r-4 border-r-primary scroll-reveal">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">terminal</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold mb-1">TYPE_STK: NETWORK</div>
      <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm mb-4 text-on-surface uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
        Ethical Hacking
      </h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8 opacity-80">
        Auditorías de infraestructura en modalidades Black, Grey y White Box, junto con una evaluación perimetral completa que incluye escaneo de puertos, análisis de firewalls y revisión de dominios.
        Entregamos un informe con riesgos priorizados y plan de remediación claro para fortalecer su seguridad de forma inmediata.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] font-mono text-primary font-bold hover:bg-primary/30 transition-colors cursor-default">INFRA_SCN</span>
        <span class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] font-mono text-primary font-bold hover:bg-primary/30 transition-colors cursor-default">NET_MAP</span>
        <span class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 px-3 py-1 text-[9px] font-mono text-primary font-bold hover:bg-primary/30 transition-colors cursor-default">WIFI_CRK</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 4: Red Team (span 2) -->
    <div class="bento-card p-6 lg:col-span-2 relative group overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 scroll-reveal">
      <div class="scanner-line"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <div class="w-fit bg-primary-container p-3 mb-6 shadow-[0_0_15px_#ff1a1a] animate-pulse-slow">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-white">security</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold mb-1">TYPE_STK: ADVERSARY_SIM</div>
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm mb-4 text-on-surface uppercase tracking-tighter">
          Ejercicios de Red Team
        </h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8 opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
          Ejercicios de Red Team con simulación de adversarios reales (replicación de APT) para poner a prueba la detección y respuesta del Blue Team. 
          El objetivo no es solo encontrar fallos, sino medir la capacidad real de reacción, 
          tiempos de respuesta y efectividad de los controles ante amenazas persistentes y avanzadas, buscando fortalecer la resiliencia operativa de su organización frente a ataques reales.
        </p>
        
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 md:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="w-full aspect-video bg-background/60 border border-primary/40 p-5 font-mono text-[10px] text-primary/80 overflow-hidden leading-tight backdrop-blur-sm">
          <div class="animate-pulse">&gt;&gt;&gt; INITIALIZING RED_TEAM PROTOCOL...</div>
          <div>&gt;&gt;&gt; TARGET: INTERNAL_DB_MAIN</div>
          <div>&gt;&gt;&gt; VECTOR: PHISHING_RECON</div>
          <div>&gt;&gt;&gt; PAYLOAD: ENCRYPTED_STAGED</div>
          <div>&gt;&gt;&gt; STATUS: <span class="text-white bg-primary px-1">[PENETRATING]</span></div>
          <div class="mt-6 text-white text-xs">DEPLOYMENT_PROGRESS: 84%</div>
          <div class="mt-2 w-full bg-white/10 h-2">
            <div class="bg-primary h-full animate-pulse" style="width: 84%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="image-container border border-primary/20 h-40">
          <div class="scanner-line" style="animation-duration: 2s"></div>
          <img
            alt="Digital Vault"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale brightness-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:brightness-100 transition-all duration-700"
            src="/image/abstract_digital_vault_with_a_glowing_red_lion_emblem_hexagonal_encryption.png"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 5: Compliance Audit -->
    <div class="bento-card p-6 relative group flex flex-col scroll-reveal">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 border border-primary/30 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-6">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">fact_check</span>
      </div>
      <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold mb-1">TYPE_STK: REGULATORY</div>
      <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm mb-4 text-on-surface uppercase group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">
        Auditoría de Cumplimiento
      </h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md mb-8 opacity-80 flex-grow">
        Alineamiento con normativas ISO 27001, NIST y SOC2 para garantizar continuidad operativa y legal.
      </p>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-highest p-5 border border-outline-variant font-mono relative overflow-hidden group-hover:border-primary/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="w-1 h-3 bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface">ISO_27001_COMPLIANT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-1 h-3 bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-bold text-on-surface">NIST_FRAMEWORK_V2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-6xl">verified_user</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Full-width circuit banner -->
    <div class="bento-card lg:col-span-2 h-64 relative group overflow-hidden scroll-reveal">
      <div class="scanner-line"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-40 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity">
        <img
          alt="Futuristic circuit board"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
          src="/image/futuristic_industrial_circuit_board_background_with_glowing_red_neon_traces.png"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-background via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-6">
        <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-primary font-bold">HARDWARE_INTEL: ACTIVE</div>
        <div class="text-[9px] font-mono text-primary/40">CIRCUIT_TRACE_0x882</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>